    "body": "1. What's the FID value you calculated?\r\n2. We will consider the api as appropriate. Shortly, the loss is calculate by this formula:\r\n![\\frac{1}{ND}\\sum_{i=1}^N |\\phi(x) - \\phi(x')|](https://latex.codecogs.com/svg.image?\\frac{1}{ND}\\sum_{i=1}^N&space;|\\phi(x)&space;-&space;\\phi(x')|), where $N$ is #images, $x$ and $x'$ is the ground-truth and prediction images, $\\phi$ maps the image to 3dmm parameters (such as `exp` etc.), $D$ is the dim of mapped feature. For head motion evaluation, `angle` and `trans` is regard as one feature.",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
